{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/intro00EN.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the young girl who cried for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gentle kami who protects children - Yukine.<br>A voice of a young girl calling for help is spread all over her shrine.\u00a0<br>The sound from the unknowned dimension that is filled with evil made Yukine rushed into it despite the danger.<br>The horrifying evil spirit restricts the power of the kami, but Yukine still explores the cursed mansion to help the girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is this mansion cursed?<br>And where is the young girl who begged for help?<br>Will Yukine be able to solve the mystery of the cursed mansion and rescue the girl from it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Gameplay\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/1202__1__1_.gif?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/\u87a2\u5e55\u64f7\u53d6\u756b\u9762_2024-12-02_110509.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes you need to combine items, solve puzzles, avoid traps and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/\u87a2\u5e55\u64f7\u53d6\u756b\u9762_2024-12-02_113957.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to proceed, it is important to help the ghosts who can't rise into Buddhahood.<br>You may even get essential items. <br>\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/chara01.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b2 Yukine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gentle kami who protects children.<br>She has been a kami for a long time, but is still a bit childish. Her favorite food is cream puffs.<br>Upon hearing the girl crying for help, she still rushed into the evil spirit world despite knowing the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/chara02.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b2 Girl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Girl trapped in the cursed mansion.\u00a0<br>She has lost all her senses and does not react to any conversation with her.<br>She seems to have only her heart left, following Yukine as if she is dependent on her.<br>She is a being between spirit and flesh. She seems to have been born in ancient times...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fox favorability MAX!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/a1b07e60923d08571beb223283c2a41de841f615.jpg"},{"name":"Rescue mission, start!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/77c2fba74ef638049c70426c3852cfdf21879cd0.jpg"},{"name":"Pah!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/053fac2bbeac9d198e991d23ed3bb709058f643c.jpg"},{"name":"I don't wanna die!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/ee01db105ce0fb02e433aab7ebb6ff443ba9f670.jpg"},{"name":"The holy light is calling me~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/d124d83ba6108c01ee887357c65e5e3cbc0bafc0.jpg"},{"name":"Hostages secured! Request evacuation!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/2b9ba5dd4d13aacaf35ff0c7837d1339f21aeb95.jpg"},{"name":"Why did it get longer?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/6d7e97688b1ecd49ac0b71b572f72f8969b7557f.jpg"},{"name":"After all, it's the Inari kami","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/22395f6bae98c06946392e23578a9ff8bf24859c.jpg"},{"name":"Did you get them all?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/7c37a68a24ba26aa0dd97622d1f6634571ab7905.jpg"},{"name":"The attacker wins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3338380/ec563686fccc6c3d87bc1d74890b6e32b9994b57.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338380?t=1739520018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739520018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/e4d1192c572f30a067eb83a474bec7ccd2901d79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739520018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/e4d1192c572f30a067eb83a474bec7ccd2901d79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739520018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/intro00EN.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the young girl who cried for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gentle kami who protects children - Yukine.<br>A voice of a young girl calling for help is spread all over her shrine.\u00a0<br>The sound from the unknowned dimension that is filled with evil made Yukine rushed into it despite the danger.<br>The horrifying evil spirit restricts the power of the kami, but Yukine still explores the cursed mansion to help the girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is this mansion cursed?<br>And where is the young girl who begged for help?<br>Will Yukine be able to solve the mystery of the cursed mansion and rescue the girl from it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Gameplay\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/1202__1__1_.gif?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/\u87a2\u5e55\u64f7\u53d6\u756b\u9762_2024-12-02_110509.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes you need to combine items, solve puzzles, avoid traps and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/\u87a2\u5e55\u64f7\u53d6\u756b\u9762_2024-12-02_113957.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to proceed, it is important to help the ghosts who can't rise into Buddhahood.<br>You may even get essential items. <br>\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/chara01.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b2 Yukine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gentle kami who protects children.<br>She has been a kami for a long time, but is still a bit childish. Her favorite food is cream puffs.<br>Upon hearing the girl crying for help, she still rushed into the evil spirit world despite knowing the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/extras/chara02.png?t=1739520018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b2 Girl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Girl trapped in the cursed mansion.\u00a0<br>She has lost all her senses and does not react to any conversation with her.<br>She seems to have only her heart left, following Yukine as if she is dependent on her.<br>She is a being between spirit and flesh. She seems to have been born in ancient times...</p>","developers":["Tsukki's Tea Party"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338380/header.jpg?t=1739520018","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091458,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091458/movie480.mp4?t=1737600518","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091458/movie_max.mp4?t=1737600518"},"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091458/77a1ea8bf67a591842233b4804885281f0708c12/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737600518","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091458/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737600518","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091458/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737600518"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257076923,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076923/movie480.mp4?t=1733277502","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076923/movie_max.mp4?t=1733277502"},"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076923/bb0b5f7995979016b0e24ce48579d5e4198c4b57/